    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the mysterious energy of the alien flora through the dilapidated systems of your crashed starship. Use buttons and levers to redirect its flow.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/330fed998f8ead89c3570f98351ded6a.poster.avif?t=1748846706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/330fed998f8ead89c3570f98351ded6a.webm?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/330fed998f8ead89c3570f98351ded6a.mp4?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infuse components with the life spark. Then plug into sockets to bring life to new areas. Tend the flowers and watch as the changing root systems rewire circuits.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/ffd15b41c7f805b8d3099ce4ca4b51c7.poster.avif?t=1748846706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/ffd15b41c7f805b8d3099ce4ca4b51c7.webm?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/ffd15b41c7f805b8d3099ce4ca4b51c7.mp4?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect seed pods and plant them to create new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your scanner to see beneath the surface. Follow the interplay of nature and technology. Learn how it can be used to further your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This charming solar-punk adventure rewards thoughtful interaction with its vibrant world. The unfolding story is as unique as the way you play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Channel the mysterious energy of the alien flora through the dilapidated systems of your crashed starship. Use buttons and levers to redirect its flow.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/330fed998f8ead89c3570f98351ded6a.poster.avif?t=1748846706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/330fed998f8ead89c3570f98351ded6a.webm?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/330fed998f8ead89c3570f98351ded6a.mp4?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infuse components with the life spark. Then plug into sockets to bring life to new areas. Tend the flowers and watch as the changing root systems rewire circuits.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/ffd15b41c7f805b8d3099ce4ca4b51c7.poster.avif?t=1748846706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/ffd15b41c7f805b8d3099ce4ca4b51c7.webm?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/ffd15b41c7f805b8d3099ce4ca4b51c7.mp4?t=1748846706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect seed pods and plant them to create new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your scanner to see beneath the surface. Follow the interplay of nature and technology. Learn how it can be used to further your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This charming solar-punk adventure rewards thoughtful interaction with its vibrant world. The unfolding story is as unique as the way you play.</p>",
